  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid-term Review: The Pacific Community (SPC) core funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid-term review of core funding for the Pacific Community (SPC) spanning 2020-2024. To assess: &lt;ol&gt;  &lt;li&gt;SPC performance in delivering on Strategic and Divisional Plans utilising core funding (focusing on DAC evaluation criteria)&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;how the funding arrangement structure and partnership approach have enabled and/or constrained success&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;how monitoring and partnership management arrangements have enabled and/or constrained success&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;any risks, issues or adjustments needed for final two years of funding.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
